From: simon.millard () gemini ! barclays ! co ! uk
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 1998 09:58:24 +0000
To: tru64-unix-managers
Subject: SUMMARY: Kernel Line for a KZPAA-AA
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=96078721911839
MIME-Version: 1
