Thanks for the help from many unix experts !


1) Create /usr/users/mailuser   home dir. owned by root
2) Add a user
3) Modify /etc/passwd to change new users`s home dir to /usr/users/mailuser
and give /dev/null as default shell
4) mkpasswd /etc/passwd

Thats all...

