who all pointed me in the right direction.  Firstly, I
was wrong when I thought the problem had affected all users
- it had only afffected a few.  What had happened was that some
of the mail spool files had been corrupted.  Pulling the files
into an editor and making sure that the first line
encountered was of the format 

From: mark@adam.ac.uk

solved the problem.

Many thanks to all.


